### 02:14:14 phase1-3 docs read via WebFetch https://playwright.dev/docs/test-components
(a) story files: *.story.tsx next to component; each named export = one scenario
(b) gallery exposes window.mount({story, props}) -> renders into #root, window.unmount(); unknown story or render error must reject
(c) story id = path under src/ without .story.* ext + export name => components/Button/Primary; any unique suffix works (Button/Primary)
(d) mount() returns a Locator scoped to story root; locator.update(props) / locator.unmount()
(e) components project: baseURL=<gallery index.html>, serviceWorkers:'block', reuseContext:true, webServer{command,url,reuseExistingServer}

